      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "DUAL CAM (8) settled in the leading division but didn't find enough in the end and could only manage fifth last start over 2200m at Marburg, that effort coming on the back of some comparable performances of late. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Tackles a similar assignment and he can bounce back to form. LETHAL LOUIE (7) finished seventh at Redcliffe two runs ago before finishing eighth at his latest appearance over 1660m at Albion Park, beaten 5.5 metres. Should enjoy a nice smother from this draw and will be looking for a split at some stage. Beautifully placed and is sure to play a major role. PENNIE PACKER (3) is in the mix following a sixth at her most recent appearance over 2040m at Redcliffe. ONE LAST ROLL (4) finished third two runs ago then did a marvellous job to salute last start in a 2138m race at Albion Park, overcoming a break to score by a nose. Live chance again in a similar assignment.",
